'''Valentine's Neneko''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] introduced in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Valentine Gals (Gacha Event)|Valentine Gals]] Gacha. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]] improves her HP and grants a 20% [[Shield Piercing]] chance.

